.\n\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\n\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\n-->\n\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\n\n- Closes #122176\n\n## Additional information\n\nCause of issue: box container measures the child minimum sizes using old cross axis dimensions. A Fit Width texture therefore uses its previous height, which keeps the label/container resizing loop out of sync.\n\nFix: Apply cross axis sizing before measuring minimum size in box container\n\nTesting: created a regression test with ai, tested pre patch and after, I also tested it manually on my machine (macOS 15.1 (24B83), Apple M1 MacBook Pro (MacBookPro17,1), 16 GB RAM.)","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-17T14:00:29Z","updated_at":"2026-10-17T15:38:07Z","closed_at":"2026-10-17T15:35:01Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"edab162cd4c2440d09a16da2937a57da33762690","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"yassienE4:issue#122176","ref":"issue#122176","repo":{"id":1423261078,"node_id":"R_kgDOVNU9lg","name":"godot","full_name":"yassienE4/godot","owner":{"login":"yassienE4","id":114497881,"node_id":"U_kgDOBtMZWQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114497881?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yassienE4","html_url":"https://github.com/yassienE4","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yassienE4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yassienE4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yassienE4/gists{/g